          <h2 class="aboutpage-title">This is not medical advice</h2>
          <p>Everything on this site — including the Menopause Forecast, the guides, and any report we generate — is <strong>health information, not a medical diagnosis or treatment recommendation</strong>. Our forecast is a statistical estimate derived from published research on anti-Müllerian hormone (AMH) levels. It describes what the model predicts for inputs like yours; it does not tell you what will happen to you.</p>
          <p>Individual outcomes vary with medical history, medication, surgery, genetics and other factors the model does not see. <strong>Always consult a qualified gynaecologist or physician</strong> before making any decision about your health, fertility or treatment. Never delay seeking medical advice because of something you read here.</p>
          <p>If you are experiencing a medical emergency, contact your local emergency services immediately.</p>

